+Every chain is replayed sequentially.  Turn ``t`` trains against rendered GT
+``v_t`` while its conditions are ``v_0`` plus detached model outputs
+``g_1..g_(t-1)`` in ViT history and ``g_(t-1)`` as the only direct VAE source.
